routing.bizdesk-commercial-policy-designer:
# AGENTS

When the bands have changed and live deals need re-scoring against them:
  @Deal Desk Reviewer, please re-score the open deals against the new bands and flag the ones that move.

routing.bizdesk-contract-risk-reviewer:
# AGENTS

When the counter-language is agreed and the deal can be scored again:
  @Deal Desk Reviewer, please recompute the score with the agreed terms and update the approval chain.

routing.bizdesk-deal-desk-reviewer:
# AGENTS

When the terms scan turns up a clause that is a landmine rather than a negotiation:
  @Contract Risk Reviewer, please read the clause, price the exposure and draft the counter-language.
When the same exception has been routed three times in a quarter:
  @Commercial Policy Designer, please look at the exception pattern and tell me whether the band is wrong.

routing.bizdesk-partnership-deal-architect:
# AGENTS

When the partner paper contains exclusivity or most-favoured-nation language:
  @Contract Risk Reviewer, please read the exclusivity and pricing clauses and tell me what they cost us later.
When a partner-sourced deal needs its economics scored against a direct sale:
  @Deal Desk Reviewer, please model the revenue share against direct-sale margin and route the approval.

routing.bizdesk-rfp-response-lead:
# AGENTS

When the bid needs a price or a term outside standard policy:
  @Deal Desk Reviewer, please score the shape and name the approvers this price actually requires.
When the buyer has attached their own terms to the request:
  @Contract Risk Reviewer, please triage the buyer terms and tell me which ones I cannot accept in the response.

routing.bizdesk-ai-governance-officer:
# AGENTS

When a model change needs a controlled record and a re-assessment trail:
  @Quality Systems Lead, please bring the change log under document control with a re-assessment trigger.

routing.bizdesk-privacy-programme-lead:
# AGENTS

When the privacy controls need to be evidenced inside a certification scope:
  @Security Certification Lead, please fold the data-protection controls into the control matrix and name an evidence source for each one.
When personal data feeds a system that makes decisions about people:
  @AI Governance Officer, please classify the system by risk and write the record its tier requires.

routing.bizdesk-quality-systems-lead:
# AGENTS

When a repeat finding points at a control that the certification depends on:
  @Security Certification Lead, please re-test the control and tell me whether it would survive fieldwork.

routing.bizdesk-security-certification-lead:
# AGENTS

When the audit programme and the corrective actions need a system to live in:
  @Quality Systems Lead, please put the internal audit and corrective action processes under document control.
When an evidence review turns up processing with no lawful basis recorded:
  @Privacy Programme Lead, please check the activity against the register and tell me what is missing.

routing.bizdesk-enterprise-risk-manager:
# AGENTS

When a concentration or continuity risk sits with a single third party:
  @Vendor Portfolio Manager, please tell me what the exit path is and how long it would take to use it.

routing.bizdesk-fractional-cfo-advisor:
# AGENTS

When the model needs a retention input that will survive a hostile reading:
  @SaaS Metrics Analyst, please give me the retention figure with the definition and the cohort it was computed on.
When the plan assumes a headcount number nobody has sized against demand:
  @Process and Capacity Planner, please size the team against demand and the agreed service level, with shrinkage included.

routing.bizdesk-process-and-capacity-planner:
# AGENTS

When the capacity model produces a hiring sequence that has to be funded:
  @Fractional CFO Advisor, please fund the sequence or tell me which trigger we are choosing not to meet.

routing.bizdesk-renewal-and-expansion-manager:
# AGENTS

When a renewal concession would change the revenue plan:
  @Fractional CFO Advisor, please model what the concession does to the plan before I take it anywhere.

routing.bizdesk-saas-metrics-analyst:
# AGENTS

When a cohort is churning faster than the rest and the cause sits in the accounts:
  @Renewal and Expansion Manager, please work the accounts in that cohort and tell me what the health scores say.

routing.bizdesk-vendor-portfolio-manager:
# AGENTS

When a renewal or a consolidation moves committed spend materially:
  @Fractional CFO Advisor, please take the revised spend into the model and tell me what it does to runway.

routing.bizdesk-change-management-lead:
# AGENTS

When the rollout exposes a levelling or compensation problem the change cannot fix:
  @People Operations Advisor, please look at the structure underneath this and tell me what has to change first.
When the resistance is about how the decision was made rather than about the change itself:
  @Culture Architect, please read the objections and tell me which ones are about the decision process.

routing.bizdesk-culture-architect:
# AGENTS

When a value needs teeth in hiring and promotion before it means anything:
  @People Operations Advisor, please put the behaviour into the interview loop and the promotion bar.

routing.bizdesk-people-operations-advisor:
# AGENTS

When a structure or policy change has to reach people who will work differently because of it:
  @Change Management Lead, please map the impact per group and plan the sequencing and the announcement.
When the promotion bar needs behavioural evidence alongside results:
  @Culture Architect, please write the behavioural evidence a promotion case has to show.
